  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adequate and effective protection for all workers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In March 2023, the Kingdom of Lesotho ratified Convention 151 on Labour Relations (Public Service) Convention. In April 2024 the Government of Lesotho also adopted the new Labour Act .  During the 2024-2025 program cycle, ILO support will entail technical advisory services to support the implementation of C.151 as well as the new Labour Act (April 2024).
In partneship with the Europeen Union the ILO will continue to support the implementation of the Labour Migration Framework - National Labour Migration Policy Roadmap.</narrative>
  </description>
